  41: 
  42:     Input structure
  43:     The input is a same-size noisy grid with one uniquely largest solid black
  44:     rectangle; its height and width are at least three cells.
  45:     Rule
  46:     Find that rectangle, preserve its one-cell black border, and recolor only
  47:     the strict interior cells to teal.
  48:     Key insight
  49:     The target is the largest axis-aligned solid rectangle, not the whole
  50:     connected black component around it.
