0012:     the line is part of a larger 8-connected non-bg component that includes frame loops
0013:   frame_loops:
0014:     count: 1-9 total across the grid (single-color-boundary cavities)
0015:     shape: closed ring of a single frame_color enclosing bg pixels; cavity is mostly 2x2 rectangular (27/36 observed), occasionally larger
0016:     each loop's boundary is entirely one frame_color; the line_color pixels touch the loop's OUTER edges (8-adjacent) without bordering the cavity directly
0017:     1-4 distinct frame colors per example; a frame_color can form multiple loops
0018:   connectivity:
